{"step_index":1275,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:50:51Z","input_tokens":7571,"cache_read_tokens":246834,"output_tokens":798,"content":"Prepared the implementation plan in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) (`Patch 1.0.25`) to add the multi-quiz Dashboard and auto-named student downloads.\n\n### Planned Overview\n1. **Minimalist Quiz Dashboard (`#view-dash`) & `Dashboard` Button ([teacher.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)):**\n   - **Dashboard screen** (landing view when no `?quiz=` param is in the URL; returns here anytime via the **`Dashboard`** button): hides the editor tabs and floating Options trigger so only the quiz rows (`Load Quiz 1` + `Rename`, `Load Quiz 2` + `Rename`, plus any added quizzes) and **`Add more Quiz`** are displayed.\n   - **Masked metadata query (`:runQuery` with `select`):** Lists quizzes using only `{ label, quizOrder, title }` (`~523 bytes`, skipping `template`'s `364KB` payload) with `Quiz 1` mapped to existing `active` and `Quiz 2` to `quiz_2`.\n   - **Rename & Add more Quiz:** Lightweight `#rename-modal` updates `{ label, quizOrder }` cleanly in Firestore (preserved across `Save to Quiz`); **`Add more Quiz`** creates persistent `quiz_3`, `quiz_4`, etc.\n   - **Load Quiz workspace:** Clicking **`Load ...`** opens that quiz's **`Quiz Editor`** + **`Submissions`** (where `Clear Students` continues handling reset lock per `Patch 1.0.24`) along with the top **`Dashboard`** button.\n2. **Auto-Named Standalone Student Quiz Downloads ([teacher.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html) & [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html)):**\n   - **`Download Quiz File`** auto-names the `.html` file from the quiz's Dashboard/renamed name (e.g. `Quiz 1.html`, `Quiz 2.html`, or sanitized custom name via `sanitizeFilename()`).\n   - [index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html) reads `quizId` from `#local-db-vault` when opened without `?quiz=` in the URL so downloaded files (like `Quiz 2.html`) connect to their own quiz and isolate their `localStorage` lock cleanly.\n\nPlease review [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and confirm if you'd like me to proceed (and let me know if you want `Submissions` & `Reset` kept combined under `Clear Students` as planned, or split back into a separate tab)."}
