{"step_index":1301,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:53:28Z","input_tokens":4103,"cache_read_tokens":279681,"output_tokens":3458,"thinking":"Examining `syncSubViewState()` and `syncSubPoller()` functions, specifically lines 420-470, the event listener for 'visibilitychange' is found within `document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', syncSubPoller)`.\n\n\nThe visibility change event listener in `syncSubPoller()` automatically stops polling when the Dashboard is active due to the `.hide` class on the `#view-sub` element. Analyzing the boot initialization, the presence or absence of the `?quiz=` URL parameter dictates whether a specific quiz is loaded or the Dashboard is shown. Loading a quiz from the URL unhides the main navigation, and the editor tab, while missing the parameter shows the Dashboard initially.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\\\scratch\\\\obf_tool\\\\tmp_backup\\\\teacher.html\"","Replacement":"\"let currentLockEpoch = 0;\\n\\nfunction defaultLabelFor(id) {\\n  if (id === 'active') return 'Quiz 1';\\n  if (id === 'quiz_2') return 'Quiz 2';\\n  const m = /^quiz_(\\\\d+)$/.exec(id);\\n  return m ? 'Quiz ' + m[1] : id;\\n}\\n\\nfunction defaultOrderFor(id) {\\n  if (id === 'active') return 1;\\n  if (id === 'quiz_2') return 2;\\n  const m = /^quiz_(\\\\d+)$/.exec(id);\\n  return m ? Number(m[1]) : 999;\\n}\\n\\nfunction mergeQuizCatalog(remote) {\\n  const map = new Map();\\n  map.set('active', { id: 'active', label: 'Quiz 1', quizOrder: 1, title: '' });\\n  map.set('quiz_2', { id: 'quiz_2', label: 'Quiz 2', quizOrder: 2, title: '' });\\n  (remote || []).forEach(r => {\\n    if (!r || !r.id) return;\\n    const prev = map.get(r.id) || {};\\n    map.set(r.id, {\\n      id: r.id,\\n      label: r.label || prev.label || defaultLabelFor(r.id),\\n      quizOrder: r.quizOrder || pre